QUERY NAME: _WGGUpdate
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT [gradecode] & "_" & [old workgroup] AS oldWGG, [gradecode] & "_" & [new workgroup] AS newWGG, [_NewStaffWG].StaffID
FROM _NewStaffWG
WHERE ((([gradecode] & "_" & [old workgroup])<>[gradecode] & "_" & [new workgroup]));

